 4. 🐊 1 sports thing: Gators crack top 10 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: AP ; Table: Axios Visuals The University of Florida made a massive jump in the latest college football AP Top 25 rankings, landing in the top 10 for the first time in five years.

 🏈 The Gators' 24-point win over then-No. 4 Mississippi under first-year coach Jon Sumrall earned them a 13-spot promotion to No. 8.

 That's their highest ranking since 2020, and first top-10 appearance since 2021. 🥇 Texas, Georgia and Notre Dame still hold the top three spots.

